Package: imageAnalysis
Title: SparkR Image Analysis Package for Stacking Queryable Images
Authors@R: person("Brendan", "Kenna", email = "Brendan.Kenna.BK@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for stacking queryable images into HDFS compatible formats 
    using SparkR and generating transformed image matrices utilizing SQL statements. 
    Designed to work natively alongside decentralized workflow orchestration layers.
